# [NETCONF](../wg/netconf.html)

## Summary

The NETCONF Working Group met at IETF 127 to review the status of active documents, discuss updates to chartered work items, and consider new telemetry and data model proposals. Key discussions focused on resolving Working Group Last Call (WGLC) comments for list pagination, progressing QUIC transport specifications, defining centralized error registries, detailing call home mechanisms over QUIC, and refining YANG Push Version 2 architecture.

