## Decisions and Action Items

### Decisions
1. **List Pagination (`draft-ietf-netconf-list-pagination*`):** Protocol-specific capabilities for NETCONF and RESTCONF will be retained. YANG Library remains mandatory as the authoritative source for module presence.
2. **YANG Push v2 (`draft-ietf-netconf-yang-push-2`):** Simplified message primitives to `update` and `delete`. Pulled envelope structures and distributed publisher definitions directly into the draft rather than referencing external drafts.
3. **Sequence Numbers in YANG Push:** Hybrid Logical Clocks will not be included in the core `draft-ietf-netconf-yang-push-2` specification.

